@startuml
title Shipment State Machine
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
  BorderColor #E65100
}
[*] --> Created
Created --> LabelCreated : Label generated
LabelCreated --> PickedUp : Courier pickup
PickedUp --> InTransit : Departed origin
InTransit --> OutForDelivery : Arrived at destination
OutForDelivery --> Delivered : Recipient accepts
OutForDelivery --> FailedAttempt : Delivery attempt failed
FailedAttempt --> OutForDelivery : Retry delivery
FailedAttempt --> ReturnedToSender : Attempts exhausted
InTransit --> ReturnedToSender : Carrier return
Created --> ReturnedToSender : Shipment cancelled
Delivered --> [*]
ReturnedToSender --> [*]
@enduml
